1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,300
For "old China" everyone flies to Beijing or Xi'an. They skip this one.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,600
Chengdu is one of the few big cities to keep its name and spot for 2,300 years.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:10,000
The Shu kingdom set its capital here around 311 BC.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,300
Teahouses, fiery hotpot, pandas just outside town — all in one ancient city.

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,300
Most underrated old city in China? Tell me I'm wrong.
